OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny rain
OL,6,Fshould soon clear, leaving a dry night
OL,7,Fwith some cloudy periods. The wind
OL,8,Fgradually eases to a light breeze.
OL,9,FFeeling cool inland as temperatures
OL,10,Fdrop to single figures, allowing some
OL,11,Ffog patches and a grass frost to
OL,12,Fdevelop.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FAny fog soon clearing to leave
OL,15,Fhazy sunshine for most of the day.
OL,16,FFeeling warm in the afternoon
OL,17,Fsunshine, as the wind remains light
OL,18,Ffor most. Rain may develop overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
