OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,6,Fand partly cloudy on Tuesday, becoming
OL,7,Fvery warm by the afternoon and staying
OL,8,Funusually mild overnight. Heavy rain,
OL,9,Ffollowed by the odd shower, on
OL,10,FWednesday. Some showers on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
